        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-2674] Each V2G entity shall support signature operations using ECC based elliptic curve (secp521r1[SECG notation]) with signature algorithm ECDSA (for ISO 15118-1, use case element ID: F1).",
            "block_bbox": [
