        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-2319] Each V2G entity shall additionally support signature operations with ECC algorithm Ed448 (for ISO 15118-1, use case element ID: F1), i.e. signature algorithm EdDSA using elliptic curve Curve448 (or Curve448-Goldilocks) in Edwards form, see IETF RFC 7748 and IETF RFC 8032.",
            "block_bbox": [
                68,
