        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "NOTE 4 In case V2G entity chooses to use Curve448-based signature algorithm, it also uses ECC-based DH algorithm X448 defined for this curve (see IETF RFC 7405), in addition to the algorithms specified by NIST Special Publication 800-56A. See also [V2G20-2710] and [V2G20-2711].",
            "block_bbox": [
