        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-2320]\nMultiple algorithms are integrated to allow for cryptographic agility. Each V2G entity shall implement a secure configurable mechanism to securely switch usage of (elliptic curve) EC from that defined in [V2G20-2674] to the one defined by [V2G20-2319] and prevent the usage of a particular algorithm, e.g. in case a security flaw was found in the preferred ECC algorithm.",
